swer is \"II and III only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-150011/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "dab6bfb9-608d-5ff8-88e7-5aa9612acda4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-150011"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-125706/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "652bdfea-cf18-5887-98ff-8cafd23cac76" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125706/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "cbfc4c60-3074-5d1d-80f5-39fd39fa5350" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125706/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "95ebdc0b-6fbd-5993-8398-46a3ef0cd796" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125706/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "3beba5a7-34d0-59e5-b86d-f840a2a63846" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125706/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "9958a797-a07d-5cb4-b83a-58f1449e3571" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125706/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "15fb2fcb-208f-5d2e-b474-7aadb612dfbe" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-125706/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer-field/choices ["q-125706/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" "q-125706/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" "q-125706/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" "q-125706/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" "q-125706/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-125706" :question/id #uuid "580fbaed-1cdc-58b4-9a9d-1b00c91726ee" :question/math-academy-id "q-125706" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14058183/assets/a423ab56220e438fb849d2025ab53b99bb74ef598e16110c911d691680130527.png)\n\nConsider the semicircle and constant vector field $F$ shown above. Let $C$ be the path where the semicircle is traversed from $A$ to $B.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\n- ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0$\n- ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=0$\n- ${\\int }_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r$ gives the total work done by a force $F$ in moving a particle along $C:$\n\n- If the force works *with* the motion of the particle (i.e., the force helps to push the particle along the path), then ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0.$\n\n- If the force works *against* the motion of the particle (i.e., the force impedes the motion of the particle as it moves along the path), then ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0.$\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement.\n\n- Statements I is false, while statement II is true. As the particle moves from $A$ to $B,$ the force $F$ works  against the particle for $x<0,$ while $F$  works with the particle for $x>0.$ \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14058183/assets/cd52e91c72d481980c9a48575da7ca3eaebd2ed27f96b1054cf5c1c5da1aa3d9.png)\n\n \nBy symmetry, the contribution to ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r$ for $x<0$ is canceled out by the contribution for $x>0.$ So, \n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=0.\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false. If we reverse the orientation of $C,$ then the situation with regards to the work done by $F$ is similar to the previous case.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14058183/assets/a1e8fa5262fc787b691b3753fc57ab39aceee7c57dbbe166c6da6f6effaf42dc.png)\n\n \nSo, ${\\int }_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-125706/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "dab6bfb9-608d-5ff8-88e7-5aa9612acda4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-125706"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-125487/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "63ef68cc-89b3-5d96-873f-6f430c621bd1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125487/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "c42738f0-e1e4-5a0a-bb57-21ed74e26116" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125487/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "0f19d4fe-a29e-50e0-a364-e7bb4c4ab599" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125487/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "b297bf1b-ba01-530c-9489-35546f679061" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125487/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "73a63d73-1815-5810-a014-fd5650640211" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125487/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d4349d8d-9b28-5483-b0b2-f2159